     1769                       f-sale-sum   = f-sale-sum + ub.gds-obj.fact-sale
     1770                       .
     1771                   End.
     1772                   f-sale-other = 100 * determined((f-sale-sum - f-cost-sum) / f-cost-sum).
     1773                       if itog = false
     1774                           Then DO:
     1775                               if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     1776                               excel-qnty(f-qnty        )        CHR(9)
