     1813                 if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     1814                 "Итого"                                             CHR(9)
     1815                 'по произв.'
     1816                 var-client                                          CHR(9) CHR(9) CHR(9) CHR(9)
     1817                 .
     1818                 for each obj-list no-lock :
