     1829                       end.
     1830                       Else do:
     1831                           if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     1832                           0 CHR(9)
     1833                           if p-cost then (  CHR(9) ) else ""
     1834                           if p-sale then (  CHR(9) ) else ""
     1835                           if p-dis  then (  CHR(9) ) else ""
     1836                           .
     1837                       end.
